mail.verifyText:
Hi {username},

to confirm the email address of your {site} account, open this link:

{link}

The link is valid for 48 hours. If you didn't sign up, ignore this email: without confirmation the address won't be used.

{site}

mail.resetText:
Hi {username},

you asked to change the password of your {site} account. To choose a new one, open this link:

{link}

The link is valid for one hour and works only once. If it wasn't you, ignore this email: your password stays the same.

{site}

mail.reportText:
Hi,

we're writing about the report you sent on {site}.

{outcome}

If you disagree with the decision, you can reply to this email and tell us why.

{site}
